{
  "_comment": "Rename to reasoning.json — real captured CCR → LiteLLM reasoning request.",
  "_notes": [
    "CCR sends 'reasoning' dict (NOT OpenAI 'reasoning_effort' string).",
    "reasoning.effort is derived from Anthropic thinking.budget_tokens via getThinkLevel():",
    "  budget_tokens <= 1024  → effort: 'low'",
    "  budget_tokens <= 8192  → effort: 'medium'",
    "  budget_tokens >  8192  → effort: 'high'",
    "reasoning.enabled=true is always set when thinking is active.",
    "LiteLLM translates this to reasoning_effort before sending to upstream."
  ],
  "model": "anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-5",
  "messages": [
    {"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant. Think carefully."},
    {"role": "user", "content": "Solve: if x + 3 = 7, what is x?"}
  ],
  "max_tokens": 1024,
  "reasoning": {
    "effort": "medium",
    "enabled": true
  }
}
